<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns a 2DA integer based on the specified Row and Column values.  Use GetM2DAInt 
if you don't know the hashed value of the column.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Note that nRow is the value in the ID field of the row you wish to access.
</p><p><br />
